  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p>■ 사회보장급여 관련 공통서식에 관한 고시 [별지 제1호서식] &lt;개정 2024.12.20.&gt;</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">사회보장급여 신청(변경)서</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center">(4쪽 중 1쪽)</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="처리기간">
        <table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>처리기간</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>별도안내</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
