        <table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>신청인</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>성명</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>주민등록번호 (외국인등록번호)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>세대주와의 관계　전화번호</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>주소</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>(실거주지 주소¹) :</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p>휴대전화²)　전자우편</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <table:table table:name="가족사항">
        <table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="8"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell><text:p>가족사항</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>세대주와의 관계</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>성명</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>주민등록번호 (외국인등록번호 등)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>동거여부(미동거사유)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>학력·재학여부(학교명/학년반)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>건강상태(장애/질병)　취업상태(직업/직장명)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell><text:p>전화번호(집/직장)</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
