        <table:table-row><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p>1. 배우자 관계³) ([ ] 법률혼 [ ] 사실혼 [ ] 사실상 이혼)　2. 외국여권 소지자명⁴): __________, __________</text:p>
      <text:p>3. 국외출생자명⁵): __________, __________　4. 복수국적자명⁶): __________, __________</text:p>
